      4. On refusal, offer a fresh worktree path rather than just saying no?
      5. Cross-repo scopes are real, not hypothetical: `ohjaa fleet` found a live
         codex session in vartio declaring scope over /Users/yair/projects/ahti,
         /ruuma, /jalki, /tapio — and paths outside any repo entirely. A sibling
         in another repo can therefore declare scope reaching into yours. Does
         that count as occupancy, and is `run` even the place to check it?
    """
